   "reviewed": {
    "by": "claude",
    "date": "2026-11-05",
    "note": "nono (nono.sh), a capability-based sandbox for agents, required by guarddog to sandbox its own scans. Its Rust module's network / process imports and strings (cloud metadata addresses 169.254.169.254 / 169.254.170.2, 1Password / Bitwarden / keyring schemes, auth.openai.com, claude.ai) are its credential-injection proxy and metadata blocking. The gate never imports guarddog, so it never runs here. Scanner venv only. Attestation verifies (nolabs-ai/nono-py, auto-release.yml). Full capa (32 MB): the night scan."
   },
